      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Optional official YouTube publishing\nAuthorize on your own PC using scripts/youtube_auth.py. Set the same Header Auth credential on the HTTP node. Default privacy is private. Never enable node-level retries for this upload POST: service blocks uncertain results; inspect YouTube Studio first.\n\nFirst test must be private/unlisted. To later publish publicly, config needs allow_public=true and private_test_video_id from a confirmed prior private/unlisted upload. Every job still requires review.\n\nAPI quota and unverified-project restrictions apply. This workflow was built without your channel credentials.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 680
      }
    }
